    '["Marinate beef in soy sauce, lemon (or calamansi), and ground black pepper for at least 1 hour.","Note: marinate overnight for best result","Heat the cooking oil in a pan then pan-fry half of the onions until the texture becomes soft.","Set aside","Drain the marinade from the beef.","Set it aside.","Pan-fry the beef on the same pan where the onions were fried for 1 minute per side.","Remove from the pan.","Set aside","Add more oil if needed.","Saute garlic and remaining raw onions until onion softens.","Pour the remaining marinade and water.","Bring to a boil.","Add beef.","Cover the pan and simmer until the meat is tender.","Note: Add water as needed.","Season with ground black pepper and salt as needed.","Top with pan-fried onions.","Transfer to a serving plate.","Serve hot.","Share and Enjoy!"]'::jsonb,
