    '["Preheat the oven to fan 180C/conventional 200C/gas 6.","Generously butter six non-stick friand or muffin tins.","Melt the butter and set aside to cool.","Sift the icing sugar and flour into a bowl.","Add the almonds and mix everything between your fingers.","Whisk the egg whites in another bowl until they form a light, floppy foam.","Make a well in the centre of the dry ingredients, tip in the egg whites and lemon rind, then lightly stir in the butter to form a soft batter.","Divide the batter among the tins, a large serving spoon is perfect for this job.","Sprinkle a handful of blueberries over each cake and bake for 15-20 minutes until just firm to the touch and golden brown.","Cool in the tins for 5 minutes, then turn out and cool on a wire rack.","To serve, dust lightly with icing sugar."]'::jsonb,
