    '["Heat olive oil in a large pot.","Cut beef into 1 inch (2.5 cm) cubes and brown in oil.","Dice the onion and add to browning beef.","Add the stock and bring to a boil, then lower the heat, cover, and let simmer for about 30 minutes.","Peel and cut the rutabaga and celery root into 1 inch (2.5 cm) cubes.","Add to the pot, cover, and continue simmering for another 30 minutes.","Peel and chop the rest of the vegetables into 1 inch (2.5 cm) cubes and add to the pot.","Slice the leek into rings.","Cover and continue simmering for about 20 minutes.","Stir as little as possible.","Top with fresh parsley."]'::jsonb,
