    '["Cook the quinoa following the pack instructions, then rinse in cold water and drain thoroughly.","Meanwhile, mix the butter, chilli and garlic into a paste.","Toss the chicken fillets in 2 tsp of the olive oil with some seasoning.","Lay in a hot griddle pan and cook for 3-4 mins each side or until cooked through.","Transfer to a plate, dot with the spicy butter and set aside to melt.","Next, tip the tomatoes, olives, onion, feta and mint into a bowl.","Toss in the cooked quinoa.","Stir through the remaining olive oil, lemon juice and zest, and season well.","Serve with the chicken fillets on top, drizzled with any buttery chicken juices."]'::jsonb,
