    '["Put the garlic in a bowl with the ginger, lemon juice, oil, spices and seasoning.","Blitz with a hand blender until smooth, then use to coat the lamb chops on both sides.","Leave to marinate in the fridge for a couple of hours or overnight.","Heat a barbecue until hot.","Barbecue the chops over the coals for 3 mins on each side until cooked but still pink and juicy in the centre."]'::jsonb,
