    '["Grease and line a 20 x 20cm/8\" x 8\" baking tin with parchment paper.","Put the mars bars and butter in a heat proof bowl and place over a pan of barely simmering water.","Mixing with a whisk, melt until the mixture is smooth.","Pour over the rice krispies in a mixing bowl and mix until all the ingredients are evenly combined.","Press evenly into the prepare baking tin and set aside.","Melt the milk chocolate in the microwave or over a pan of barely simmering water.","Spread the melted chocolate over the rice krispie mixture and leave to set in a cool place.","Once set slice into squares and serve!"]'::jsonb,
