    '["Heat the oil in a skillet over medium heat.","When hot, add the diced onion and cook until lightly browned.","Add the curry powder and salt to taste and toast for a few seconds.","Add the chopped tomatoes and the water, stir well, and cook until the tomatoes begin to break down, 5-7 minutes.","Add in the chopped (or baby) spinach and cook for 7-10 minutes more, until soft and wilted."]'::jsonb,
