    '["# Healthy Jaggery Modak","**Added by:** Ameya","Take the grated coconut in a bowl.","Add jaggery to the grated coconut.","Mix the coconut and jaggery thoroughly until they are evenly combined.","Take small portions of the mixture and shape them into modaks using your hands or a modak mould.","Repeat until all the mixture has been used.","Serve the freshly prepared jaggery coconut modaks."]'::jsonb,
