    '["Equipment","Dutch oven","Add rice, coconut milk, kidney beans, water, kosher salt, allspice, and black pepper to a large pot and stir until combined.","Lay green onions, thyme and Scotch bonnet pepper on top.","Bring mixture to a boil.","Once boiling, reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.","Allow to cook covered for 18 minutes over low heat, then remove from heat.","Leave the lid on for an additional 5 minutes.","Open the lid and remove the green onion, Scotch bonnet pepper, and thyme.","Fluff the rice and peas with a fork.","Serve and enjoy."]'::jsonb,
