    '["Caramelize the chicken with olive oil then add a maggi cube and boil it for around 30 minutes.","In another pot, add all the veggies and caramelize them till they are soft.","Once everything is done, add the rice, raisins & spices to the veggies and add 2 and a half cups of water for the rice to cook.","Once the rice is done put everything in the oven."]'::jsonb,
