    '["Cut the meat into strips.","Heat oil in a pan and fry the strips for 6 minutes until it''s ready.","Bake the fries until golden brown in a deep fryrer.","When ready transfer to a backing dish.","Make sure the fries are spread over the whole dish.","Cover the fries with a new layer of meat and spread evenly.","Add a layer of cheese over the meat.","You can also use grated cheese.","When done put in the oven for a few minutes until the cheese is melted.","Chop the lettuce, tomato and cucumber in small pieces and mix together. for a basic salad.","As extra you can add olives jalapenos and a red union.","Dived the salad over the dish and Serve with garlicsauce and hot sauce"]'::jsonb,
