    '["Grate half an onion and set aside.","Slice the rest of the onions and fry in butter on low/medium heat until caramelized.","In a bowl, mix together ground beef, grated onion, salt, pepper, nutmeg, potato/corn starch, and water.","Form into a sausage and cut 6 patties.","Using a knife make a light grid pattern in each patty.","Brown both sides of the karbonader in butter on high heat, then turn down to low heat and fry for another 2 – 3 minutes.","Serve the karbonader and onions with potatoes, stewed peas, and brown sauce for dinner, or on a slice of bread for lunch or a snack."]'::jsonb,
