    '["Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).","Pour the milk into a saucepan along with the lemon zest and cinnamon sticks.","Bring to a simmer over medium-high heat, then reduce heat to low, and cook for 5 minutes.","Turn heat off, and allow to steep for 15 minutes.","Gently beat the eggs and sugar together until the sugar has dissolved.","Slowly beat in 1 cup of the hot milk, a little at a time, until it has been incorporated.","Stir the egg mixture back into the hot milk, pour in the pisco, and mix until well combined.","Pour the custard through a fine mesh sieve into a 2-quart ceramic casserole dish to remove the lemon zest and cinnamon.","Bake in preheated oven until set, and browned on top, about 30 minutes.","Chill before serving."]'::jsonb,
