    '["Steps for the Meat:","Roast meat over medium heat for 50 minutes and salt it as you turn it.","Steps for Ugali:","Bring the water and salt to a boil in a heavy-bottomed saucepan.","Stir in the cornmeal slowly, letting it fall through the fingers of your hand.","Reduce heat to medium-low and continue stirring regularly, smashing any lumps with a spoon, until the mush pulls away from the sides of the pot and becomes very thick, about 10 minutes.","Remove from heat and allow to cool.","Place the ugali into a large serving bowl.","Wet your hands with water, form a ball and serve.","Steps for Kachumbari: Mix the tomatoes, onions, chili and coriander leaves in a bowl.","Serve and enjoy!"]'::jsonb,
