    '["Cook the pasta following pack instructions.","Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan and cook the onion, garlic and chilli for 3-4 mins to soften.","Stir in the tomato purée and cook for 1 min, then add the pilchards with their sauce.","Cook, breaking up the fish with a wooden spoon, then add the olives and continue to cook for a few more mins.","Drain the pasta and add to the pan with 2-3 tbsp of the cooking water.","Toss everything together well, then divide between plates and serve, scattered with Parmesan."]'::jsonb,
