    '["Combine the olive oil, lemon juice, honey and thyme leaves in a large bowl.","Season well, then tip in the lettuce, tomatoes, spring onions and chilli, and toss to combine.","Scoop out the pomegranate seeds over a bowl and remove any white membrane.","Arrange the dressed salad on a platter, then scatter over the pomegranate seeds and feta."]'::jsonb,
