    '["Boil: Bring water to a boil, gently add eggs, and cook for exactly 6½ to 7 minutes.","Ice Bath: Immediately transfer the eggs to a bowl of ice water for 3–5 minutes to stop cooking.","Marinate (Optional but recommended): Peel the eggs and marinate in a mix of 2 tbsp soy sauce, 2 tbsp mirin, 1 tsp sugar, and 4 tbsp water for at least 4 hours (or overnight).","Serve: Slice in half, letting the yolk flow into the broth"]'::jsonb,
