    '["Fire up the barbecue or heat a griddle pan to high.","Tip chicken, curry paste and coconut milk into a bowl, then mix well until the chicken is evenly coated.","Thread vegetables and chicken onto skewers.","Cook the skewers on the barbecue or griddle for 5-8 mins, turning every so often, until the chicken is cooked through and charred.","Serve with herby rice, salad and a lime half to squeeze over."]'::jsonb,
