    '["Halve the cabbage, remove the tough stem and thinly slice.","Place in a large pan with all the other ingredients apart from the sausages, then mix in 300ml water and some salt and pepper.","Bring to a simmer, then reduce the heat, cover with a well-fitting lid and gently cook for 1½ hrs, stirring frequently.","If too dry, you can add a little more water.","Add the kabanos to the cabbage mixture, place a lid on the pan and gently simmer for 20 mins.","Remove the lid and cook for a further 10 mins.","Serve alongside some simple mash or boiled potatoes."]'::jsonb,
