    '["Heat the 2 tablespoons of oil in a large skillet or pot over medium heat until shimmering.","Add the onions and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, 5 to 7 minutes.","Add the shredded kale to the onions and mix well.","Turn the heat to medium-low, cover and cook for 5 minutes.","After 5 minutes, remove the lid, add salt to taste, and stir in the cream.","Continue cooking for another 5 minutes, uncovered, stirring occasionally.","The cream will thicken slightly, making for a deliciously rich creamed kale and onions.","Serve it up with your favorite Kenyan stew, and a side of ugali!"]'::jsonb,
