    '["Heat 1/4 cup butter in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.","Add ground beef and season with salt, allspice, cinnamon, and black pepper.","Cook and stir until beef is browned and crumbly, 7 to 10 minutes.","Stir chicken broth and rice into beef in the saucepan; bring to a boil.","Reduce heat to low, cover, and cook until liquid is absorbed, about 20 minutes.","Meanwhile, melt 2 tablespoons butter in a small skillet over medium heat.","Cook and stir pine nuts in hot butter until lightly browned, 3 to 5 minutes.","Mix pine nuts into beef-rice mixture before serving."]'::jsonb,
