    '["Heat the oil in a large saucepan or flameproof casserole.","Add the spring onions and coriander stalks and cook for 1 min.","Add the pork slices and cook for 5 mins until starting to brown.","Stir in the curry paste and peanut butter.","After 30 secs, add the sugar, soy and coconut milk, plus ½ can of water.","Mix well, put a lid on and leave to simmer for 15 mins, stirring occasionally.","Remove the lid, add the baby corn and increase the heat.","Bubble for 3 mins until the corn is cooked and the sauce has thickened a little.","Stir in the lime juice and check the seasoning.","Can now be frozen for up to 2 months.","To cook from frozen: thoroughly defrost, then heat in a pan on the hob until curry is hot all the way through.","Serve scattered with the coriander leaves and rice."]'::jsonb,
